#38500
The Death Knight's Guild of Samsera~
   This is the Credit's room.  Enki started this zone on 2/8/03.  Kurse wrote
most of the guild halls, so this one will look a bit different.  Soth took over
the project on 11/23/03 and wrote his own version of the guild.  Medit save 550
included the mobs 04, 06, and 07 to all be potential questmasters with
different possible objectives.    
~
