#38501
Standing before Hellfire Keep~
   To the north, you can see Hellfire Keep, the Death Knight stronghold.  The
dark stone walls are adorned with huge, black standards bearing the symbols of
evil gods.  The Death Knights follow a strict code of combat, much like the
Solamnic Knights.  The Death Knight Code, however, is founded on the ideals of
evil and cruelty.  Only the blackest hearted villains dare enter this forsaken
place.    
~
