#38502
Before the gates of Hellfire Keep~
   Black banners bearing the symbols of dark deities wave in the breeze, young
knights in black plate armor salute you, and prisoners locked in the dungeons
scream in agony.  You are home.  This is Hellfire Keep, bastion of the Death
Knights in Samsera.  From the black stone walls of their keep, the Knights
defend the town from Elf incursions and Izarti treachery.  While the large,
reinforced gates of the keep are open wide, do not underestimate the defenses
of this fortress.  Those walking around the keep are armed to the teeth with
foully enchanted weapons.  Each knight stands ready to give his life to defend
Hellfire Keep.
~
