#38503
The gatehouse~
   You stand in the gatehouse of Hellfire Keep.  The keep is protected by metal
outer gates, a portcullis, and then reinforced inner doors.  Foolish indeed is
the person who attempts to assault the keep.  To the north, is the inside of
the keep.  To the east is a staircase leading to the southern tower of the
keep.    
~
