#38505
South Tower~
   You are now in the Hellfire Keep's South Tower.  From here, the Death
Knights can repel attacks on their keep with both arrows and foul magic.  You
see quivers full of barbed arrows lining the walls.  With sorcery such as Black
Dart at their disposal, Death Knights hardly have a use for conventional
arrows.  The roof of South Tower serves as the perch of Emertor, the Crypt
Dragon.  From the South Tower, Emertor vigilantly watches the gates of Hellfire
Keep and disposes of intruders.    
~
