#38506
The Death Knight stables~
   While not all Death Knights fight mounted, some are known to go to war
riding powerful horses.  The greatest champions of the dark gods are given
hellish nightmares by their patron demon to ride in battle.  The stables are
where the knights may have their warhorses tended to while they are not needed.
You notice both sacks grain for the warhorses and a dismembered elf for the
nightmares.    
~
