#38507
Inside the Keep~
   You stand inside the protective walls of Hellfire Keep.  A dirt path leads
north to the actual keep.  To the west, you see the stables of the knights.  
The slight scent of sulfur comes from stables.  To the east, you see an evil
temple built in a gothic cathedral style.  Death Knight lore says that the
pitch-black stone of the temple was a gift from Orcus.  Unholy runes glow
faintly above its entrance.    
~
