#38508
Dark Temple of the Death Knights~
   This is the evil temple of the Death Knights.  It is made of black, abyssal
stone broken up by stained glass windows.  The windows depict scenes of some of
the greatest death knights.  An altar, made from the same stone that the
building is constructed of sits at the far end of the cathedral.  A red cloth
covers the altar.  Implements of sacrifice and torture are ritualistically
arranged on the cloth.  In this place you might properly pray to your dark
deities and make sacrifices.  Indeed, captured slaves are kept in the dungeon
below for that very purpose.  The wonderful feeling of growing rage fills you
in this place.    
~
