#38510
The Death Knight armory~
   This is the armory of the Death Knights.  Here you will find an assortment
of evilly enchanted weapons and armor.  Some of the arms are created in the
keep itself and some are taken from other places.  Death Knights are encouraged
to place equipment found in their adventures and quests here for other Knights
to use.    
~
