#38511
Heart of Hellfire Keep~
   You are in the heart of the keep.  A large fountain provides water to the
Knights.  To the west is the keep's armory.  It is likely you can find some
useful equipment there.  To the east is a small building which houses the
ambassador from Blackheart Keep.    
~
