#38512
Lord Skul's ambassador's chambers~
   This room is built from the same dark stone that makes up the walls of the
keep.  A desk with various maps and paperwork sits here.  Lord Skul's personal
banner is on the left wall and, on the right, hangs the standard of the Death
Knights.  Lord Skul requested that an ambassador from Blackheart Keep be given
a presence in Samsera in order to keep a closer watch on the town as well as
keep up communications with the Death Knights there.  It is very likely that
Lord Skul will send orders to the Knights through his ambassador.    
~
