#38513
The war room~
   This is the war room of the Death Knights.  This is where the Death Knights
plan their campaigns throughout the land.  This is also where they can discuss
Knight business without being bothered by pesky outsiders.  A huge table
covered with maps dominates the room.  Tiny figures are arranged on the maps,
obviously representing troop movements.  Written in the archaic language of
demons on the wall around the room is the phrase "Every troop movement has
troop losses.  "
~
