#38515
The Death Knight's boardroom~
   This is the boardroom of Hellfire Keep.  A scribe takes your messages for
other Knights down on paper and posts them on a board for all to see.  Here
Knights can share their tales of adventure or concoct new methods of killing.
Sometimes, through the use of the board, the gods bestow unholy blessings and
new powers upon their chosen Knights.    
~
