#38516
The Dark Lord's chamber~
   This is where Dark Lord Surak spends most of his time mentoring younger
Knights.  While Lord Surak is more than willing to instruct you in the ways of
the evil crusader, he is merciless if you show any signs of weaknesses.  This
room is rarely cleaned so that the blood of former Death Knights who
disappointed Surak can serve as a grim reminder to new Knights.    
~
